### Initial sample accounts
GET http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/lab09/accounts

### Successful transfer: Alice 900.00, Bob 600.00 on a fresh database
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/lab09/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromId":1,"toId":2,"amount":100.00}

### Insufficient funds: 409, balances unchanged
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/lab09/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromId":1,"toId":2,"amount":100000.00}

### Invalid amount: 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/lab09/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromId":1,"toId":2,"amount":-1.00}

### All measured experiments (resets the two sample accounts)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/api/lab09/experiments
